{"3406060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "sammy.", "steam_appid": 3406060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>School trips are just the worst, aren't they?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The homesickness, the nausea - nothing ever seems to go right, does it, Sammy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/731cbbec1e032d0882399f5ad0fadf0d.gif?t=1772052959\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/731cbbec1e032d0882399f5ad0fadf0d.poster.avif?t=1772052959\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The path to the adult you’re becoming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ship docks, the students prepare to step onto the soft grass of Caelum, a small island many used to lovingly call home; no longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Caelum is nothing but a shell of what it once was, the stains of a brutal history taking it's toll on the island's few but passionate inhabitants. All that remains is a ghost town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/ef48768bac97c85dec753cc662ab706d.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> starts with accepting the child who walked before you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, above all of that, something worse has been festering here for a long time, and it's begun to manifest in strange ways. A depraved being stalks the shores in pursuit of.. something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallucinations will get you first; the bodies drop shortly after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Sammy, a socially awkward teen forced to face the world on her own as what starts off as an uncomfortable week on a small, secluded island turns into a neverending nightmare of sickness and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a few newfound friends caught in the madness, uncover the secrets of the island and the entity that stalks your every move, before it comes to reshape you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/9116f295474ef4b67eaba651b486ae48.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>'sammy.' is a top-down narrative horror experience about finding yourself.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/f92d528852c0e446dc995f9d1eb62195.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Explore your surroundings while adhering to your schedule.</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytime - During the daytime, you get to explore the island. Do what you must.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nighttime - <span class=\"bb_strike\">?ymmastiseodthgirogotsmeesrevegnihtonaesuanehtssenkcisemoheht</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluation - A time for self-reflection.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Fight for your life.</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught between two worlds - It's easy to lose your grip on reality, hold on tight. <br>Being in the company of others will help keep you attached, however if you happen to find yourself isolated and alone, you'll have to wrestle with forces dragging you into the <i>other</i> reality, and away from your own. Though in some cases, travelling between the two realities might just be what you need, as the other side holds secrets of its own. Just know that once you've passed the threshold, that.. <i>thing</i> will pursue you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/27dd616a54d3d3370345e920bb07b7d4.poster.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/27dd616a54d3d3370345e920bb07b7d4.webm?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/27dd616a54d3d3370345e920bb07b7d4.mp4?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back - The shadow hides in disguises. Different weapons, tools and the smartest your wits have to offer might just be enough to save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/2b6a06b65dd8b00ed753de41d849b22b.poster.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/2b6a06b65dd8b00ed753de41d849b22b.webm?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/2b6a06b65dd8b00ed753de41d849b22b.mp4?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror - Use mirrors to affirm that you're still you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Uncover the mysteries of Caelum</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles - Discover the truth, whether above ground or below.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_par