ed, however if you happen to find yourself isolated and alone, you'll have to wrestle with forces dragging you into the <i>other</i> reality, and away from your own. Though in some cases, travelling between the two realities might just be what you need, as the other side holds secrets of its own. Just know that once you've passed the threshold, that.. <i>thing</i> will pursue you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/27dd616a54d3d3370345e920bb07b7d4.poster.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/27dd616a54d3d3370345e920bb07b7d4.webm?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/27dd616a54d3d3370345e920bb07b7d4.mp4?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back - The shadow hides in disguises. Different weapons, tools and the smartest your wits have to offer might just be enough to save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/2b6a06b65dd8b00ed753de41d849b22b.poster.avif?t=1772052959\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/2b6a06b65dd8b00ed753de41d849b22b.webm?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406060/extras/2b6a06b65dd8b00ed753de41d849b22b.mp4?t=1772052959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror - Use mirrors to affirm that you're still you.</p></li><